t challenge!<br></li><li> Over 60 hours of addictive gameplay - <strong>with a clear ending!</strong> (Or perhaps more than one...?)</li></ul><br><br><br><strong>You do not need to have played Magic Research in order to enjoy Magic Research 2!</strong>",
